1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
清晨六点，城市还没醒。
Six a.m. The city still asleep.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
他先把烘豆机预热。
He warms up the roaster first.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
一家小店，一个人。
One small shop, one person.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
中国八成咖啡馆，都是独立小店。
Over 80% of China's cafés are independent.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
生豆是青绿色的，几乎没有香气。
Green beans — pale, almost scentless.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
入锅，滚筒开始转。
Into the drum. It starts to turn.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,500
温度爬升，豆子由绿转黄。
Heat climbs; green turns gold.

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:35,000
「啪」——第一次爆裂。
"Crack" — the first crack.

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,500
这一声，是烘焙师最紧张的时刻。
That sound: the roaster's tensest moment.

10
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:44,000
早一秒太生，晚一秒发苦。
A second early, raw. A second late, bitter.

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
慢工，出细活。
Good work takes slow hands.

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
豆子冷却，磨成细粉。
Beans cool, then grind to powder.

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
热水一压，浓缩流下来。
Water presses; espresso pours.

14
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,500
云南的豆，就在这一杯里。
Yunnan's beans live in this cup.

15
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:07,000
牛奶打到丝绸一样。
Milk steamed silky-smooth.

16
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,500
手腕一晃，一片叶子浮起来。
A flick of the wrist — a leaf appears.

17
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:16,000
这，就是拉花。
This is latte art.

18
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
第一位客人，推门进来。
The first customer pushes the door open.

19
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:26,500
一整天，几十杯，几十次问候。
All day: dozens of cups, dozens of hellos.

20
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:31,000
他记得每个熟客的口味。
He remembers each regular's taste.

21
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:35,500
天黑了，他擦净最后一台机器。
Dusk. He wipes the last machine clean.

22
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:40,000
明天的豆，已经选好。
Tomorrow's beans are already chosen.

23
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,500
择一事，终一生。
Choose one craft; give it a life.

24
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:49,000
一杯咖啡背后，是一个人的一天。
Behind one cup is one person's whole day.

25
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:53,000
关注，带你认识中国的手艺人。
Follow — meet China's makers.
